Subject: oot-detail: Ocarina of Time's model detail and shadow range for
 slower GPUs (DM_MODEL_LOD, DM_SHADOW_CASCADES; Model detail and Shadow range
 rows, full by default)

From brad-n/TVPort ba9cf51e by Brad Norman (MIT): the stubs at state page +0x304 / +0x308 (TVPort's +0xb4 / +0xb8), and docs_patches.py's dry run placing a rule's
other functions 4 MB apart (Ocarina's rule now has 16). TVPort's DM_AB_STATE measurement switch is not taken.
